@Meta's new Muse Wonder Full debuts third on the Intelligence Index at 55.8, just 0.2 behind Anthropic’s Claude Sonnet 5.5.

Claude Opus 5.5 (@AnthropicAI) still leads at 57.6. Muse Wonder Full also places ahead of OpenAI’s (@OpenAI) GPT-6 Astra (52.7) and Google’s (@Googledeepmind) Gemini 4 Argon (52.6).

Scores via https://t.co/TeTHwS52d4, Oct 12.
